//// set: io-order — 声明次序：引用写在 outer 声明前面（复合 / 标量 / 维）、根上先引用子实例里的 outer（SKIP）；根类 extends 来的 inner、嵌套 inner
//// model: I70
model A
Real x;
end A;
model B
Real y = a.x;
outer A a;
end B;
model I70
inner A a(x = time);
B b;
end I70;
//// model: I71
model B
Real y = x;
outer Real x;
end B;
model I71
inner Real x = time;
B b;
end I71;
//// model: I72
model A
Real x;
end A;
model B
outer A a;
end B;
model I72
Real z = b.a.x;
B b;
inner A a(x = time);
end I72;
//// model: I73
model A
Real x;
end A;
model B
outer A a;
end B;
model I73
inner A a(x = time);
B b;
Real z = b.a.x;
end I73;
//// model: I74
model A
parameter Integer n = 2;
end A;
model B
Real y[a.n];
outer A a;
end B;
model I74
inner A a(n = 3);
B b;
end I74;
//// model: I80
model A
outer Real x;
Real y = x;
end A;
model E
A a;
inner Real x = 1;
end E;
model I80
extends E;
end I80;
//// model: I81
model A
outer Real x;
Real y = x;
end A;
model E
inner Real x = 1;
A a;
end E;
model I81
extends E;
end I81;
//// model: I82
model A
Real x;
end A;
model B
outer A a;
Real y = a.x;
end B;
model E
inner A a(x = 1);
B b;
end E;
model I82
extends E;
end I82;
//// model: I83
model A
outer Real x;
Real y = x;
end A;
model C
inner Real x = 2;
A a;
end C;
model E
C c;
A a;
inner Real x = c.x;
end E;
model I83
extends E;
end I83;
//// model: I84
model A
outer Real x;
Real y = x;
end A;
model C
inner Real x = 2;
A a;
end C;
model I84
C c;
A a;
inner Real x = c.x;
end I84;
